# Only non-obvious redirects live here.
# CF Pages serves .html files and index.html in subdirs automatically.
# Nothing outside site/ is deployed (site/ is the Pages build output
# directory), so there is nothing to hide with 404 rules — and Pages ignores
# 404 rules in this file anyway (verified live, 4.9.2026).

/app    /sale/    301
# The helper screen has a door of its own — the link Stav sends a friend.
/help   /sale/?panel=helper   302
/Help   /sale/?panel=helper   302
/HELP   /sale/?panel=helper   302
/עזרה   /sale/?panel=helper   302

# The standalone periodic-checkups page was retired (4.9.2026): the screen
# lives inside the app. The URL was already sent to customers on WhatsApp and
# sits in bookmarks, so it keeps landing somewhere.
/checkups    /sale/    301
/checkups/*  /sale/    301

# Case tolerance for the shared /ask/ link (people type it by hand from WhatsApp)
/ASK    /ask/    301
/ASK/*  /ask/    301
/Ask    /ask/    301
/Ask/*  /ask/    301
